# Design palette

Read [`docs/DESIGN.md`](../../docs/DESIGN.md) and use tokens from [`app/design-tokens.css`](../../app/design-tokens.css).

## Rules

1. **Never** use hex literals, `text-white`, `bg-black`, or `rgb()`/`rgba()` in components or app pages.
2. Use semantic CSS variables: `var(--background)`, `var(--foreground)`, `var(--surface)`, `var(--primary)`, `var(--brand)`, `var(--accent)`, `var(--secondary)`, `var(--overlay)`, `var(--focus-ring)`, etc.
3. Run `npm run check:colors` — wired into `prelaunch` and must pass before merge.

## Token roles

| Role | Token | Use for |
|------|-------|---------|
| CTA buttons | `--primary` | Solid Add / Save / Sign in buttons, toggle on-state |
| Brand / links | `--brand` | Wordmarks, back links, settings links, guest CTA |
| Contrast pop | `--accent` | Banners, checkboxes, spinners |
| Focus | `--focus-ring` | Input focus rings |
| Organic secondary | `--secondary` | Category headers, member chips |
| Scrim | `--overlay` | Modal/sheet backdrops |
| Destructive | `--destructive` | Delete actions |

Category list headers: always `text-[var(--secondary)]` — not DB `category.color`.

## Exceptions (hex allowed)

- `app/design-tokens.css`
- `lib/design/palette.ts` (PWA only)
- `lib/pwa/icon-markup.tsx` (ImageResponse)
